WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[grunting]

00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:05.944
Dừng lại, dừng lại phải không?

00:00:05.888 --> 00:00:08.888
(sighs)

00:00:08.832 --> 00:00:11.592
(sighs)

00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:13.776
(crying)

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.720
Chết tiệt, bạn ngon quá.

00:00:17.664 --> 00:00:19.664
Bạn là ai?

00:00:20.608 --> 00:00:22.608
Sao em lại làm anh đói thế này?

00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:24.952
[laughs]
